s. Improvise. Survive Together. Get paid -- or die trying.\n\nYou and your team awaken in a brutalist underground lab, contractually bound to medical trials you definitely read the fine print for. Work together, impress the researchers and you might leave rich. Fail and you might just become part of the next experiment.\n\nWelcome to Exogen Labs. Our test chambers are filled with puzzles, hazards, and semi-successful mutant \u2018Things\u2019. No trial is ever the same, layouts will shift, enemies will mutate and puzzles are ever-evolving.\n\nComplete all the objectives and escape before the elevator timer expires, or you might expire with it!", "summary": "A chaotic first-person co-op game about surviving lethal experiments with your friends. Work together, dismember your enemies, steal their limbs and escape before time runs out.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/killing-things-with-your-friends", "videos": [{"id": 175907, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "MA4bzrp2hsI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MA4bzrp2hsI", "title": "Killing Things With Your Friends - Teaser", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MA4bzrp2hsI/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}